      <description><![CDATA[<p>Skills from a private GitHub repository, such as your team's own, are now checked with your GitHub CLI sign-in instead of looking like their source is gone. Skillori asks signed out first and uses your sign-in only when GitHub says it can't find the repository. The way back on a skill's All details page now stays in view when you scroll.</p>]]></description>
